Build Phase 1 of Hanyan Cognitive Core (HCC) - a Python FastAPI project.

Create these files in the current directory:

gateway/main.py - FastAPI app entry
gateway/api/memory_routes.py - memory CRUD routes
gateway/api/health.py - health check
gateway/core/config.py - Pydantic settings
