Memory fields: id (UUID), user_id (str), type (str), content (str), summary (str), importance (float), tags (JSON), source (str), status (str), created_at (datetime), updated_at (datetime).

Routes prefixed /api/v1:
POST /memory/store
POST /memory/search  
POST /memory/update
POST /memory/delete
GET /memory/recent
GET /health

Use asyncpg/SQLAlchemy async, Pydantic v2, proper error handling.
